Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.600
Hi there, Steve Kaufmann here today
again to talk about languages.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.800
And today I want to talk about the Russian
language and the Ukrainian language.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.060
And I have a special guest, Ksenia
Turkova, who has her own, uh, YouTube

00:00:12.065 --> 00:00:15.780
channel, which I'll leave a link to
in the description box, but many of

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.040
you may know, oh, and by the way, if
you enjoy my videos, please subscribe.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.880
Click on the bell for notifications,
and if you follow me on a podcast

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.380
service, please leave a comment.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.250
