learning, but, uh, thank you very much.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:44.310
I think, uh, a lot of my listeners will
understand more about Ukrainian and

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:49.020
Russian and how the languages are similar
and different and uh, you know, I salute

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.520
you for wanting to learn Crimean Tatar.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.570
I don't think I'll get there.

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.780
I have other languages I've gotta
